aluating patients and performing various surgical interventions, including the gastrostomy procedure.", "UNIDAD DE ENDOSCOPÍAS:Department where endoscopic procedures are performed, including attempts to place a gastrostomy", "CORTICOIDES IV:Intravenous corticosteroids administered to the patient as part of the treatment regimen", "ANTIBIOTICOTERAPIA IV:Intravenous antibiotic therapy provided to the patient to prevent or treat infections", "RADIOLOGÍA INTERVENCIONISTA:Radiología Intervencionista is a medical specialty that focuses on utilizing imaging techniques to guide minimally invasive surgical procedures. This specialty is often essential for various techniques, including gastrostomy and yeyunostomy. Within this context, the interventional radiology department has actively engaged in procedures such as the placement of a gastrostomy tube for patients, demonstrating its critical role in providing advanced medical care through minimally invasive methods.", "FLUIDOTERAPIA IV:", "CEREBRAL HOSPITAL:El hospital de daño cerebral (HDC) es un centro especializado donde se continúa el tratamiento y rehabilitación de pacientes con daño neurológico.", "MEC:MEC is a scale used to assess the level of dementia in patients.", "GDS:GDS is a scale used to measure the severity of dementia.", "BARTHEL:Barthel is a scale used to measure the degree of dependence in patients.", "FAMILY:Family refers to the relatives of the patient who are involved in decision-making regarding the patient's care and treatment.", "ENDOCINOLOGÍA Y NUTRICIÓN:Endocrinología y nutrición son servicios médicos que colaboran en el tratamiento de pacientes con problemas nutricionales.", "DIFICULTAD EN EL CONTROL GLUCÉMICO:La dificultad en el control glucémico se refiere a los problemas que enfrentan los pacientes diabéticos para mantener niveles adecuados de glucosa en sangre.", "ACCIDENTE CEREBRO VASCULAR:", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO Y POLITÉCNICO DE LA FE:Hospital Universitario y Politécnico de La Fe is a reference hospital in Valencia for nutritional assessment and treatment."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}